1️⃣ Executive Sales Dashboard

Executive Sales Dashboard — Power BI,

Interactive Power BI dashboard designed to analyze e-commerce performance through KPI cards, slicers, revenue trends,
category contribution, top-performing products, monthly orders, and customer revenue analysis.
The dashboard enables users to explore sales performance dynamically across different time periods and products.


-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------


2️⃣ SQL Database & Tables

SQL Business Analysis — Category Revenue Contribution

MySQL database containing the core e-commerce tables, including customers, products, categories, orders, order items, 
and payments. The screenshot demonstrates the database structure and sample product records used as the underlying data
source for the analytics project.



------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------


3️⃣ SQL Query & Business Analysis Output

SQL Business Analysis — Top Category Contribution

SQL analysis calculating revenue generated by each product category and its percentage contribution to overall revenue.
The query uses multiple table joins, aggregation, GROUP BY, and a window function to derive category-level business insights.


-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------


4️⃣ Power BI Data Model & Relationships


Power BI Data Model — Table Relationships


Power BI relational data model connecting customers, orders, order items, products, categories, and payments. The model 
establishes relationships between the transactional and master tables, providing the foundation for accurate filtering, 
aggregation, and dashboard analysis.




















